        ('90040000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002e', v_class9_id, 'Class 9 English Reading & Discursive Competency - Set 1', 45, 20, 0.00, true, 'English', 'COMPETENCY', 'Class 9', 'Time Allowed: 45 Minutes. Max Marks: 20. 15 minutes reading time provided. Adhere strictly to word limits in Writing and Literature sections.', 'Reading Comprehension & Critical Analysis (20 Marks)'),
